<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Heavy in $130 mln Malaysia order.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Heavy in $130 mln Malaysia order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hyundai Heavy Industries Co Ltd said on Thursday it has won a $130 order from Malaysia's Hongkew to build cement facilities on a turn-key basis.</p>
</text>
